{"ticker":"AJG","updated":"2026-10-23T22:35:27Z","profile":{"longName":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co.","shortName":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ajg.com","fullTimeEmployees":67456,"marketCap":68709642240,"trailingPE":44.451077,"forwardPE":18.103045,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.547597,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":283.33334,"targetHighPrice":388.0,"targetLowPrice":242.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.309,"earningsGrowth":-0.107,"grossMargins":0.43186,"operatingMargins":0.1916,"profitMargins":0.10378,"totalRevenue":15109000192,"beta":0.547,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":284.17,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":190.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.03},"summary":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co., together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance and reinsurance brokerage, consulting, and third-party property/casualty claims settlement and administration services to entities and individuals worldwide. The company operates in Brokerage and Risk Management segments. Its Brokerage segment offers retail and wholesale insurance and reinsurance brokerage services; assists retail brokers and other non-affiliated brokers in the placement of specialized and hard-to-place insurance; and acts as a brokerage wholesaler, managing general agent, and managing general underwriter for distributing specialized insurance coverages to underwriting enterprises. This segment performs activities, including marketing, underwriting, issuing policies, collecting premiums, appointing and supervising other agents, paying claims, and negotiating reinsurance; and offers services in the areas of insurance and reinsurance placement, risk of loss management, and management of employer sponsored benefit programs. The Risk Management segment provides contract claim settlement and administration services; and claims management, loss control consulting, and insurance property appraisal services. The company offers its services through a network of correspondent brokers and consultants. It serves commercial, industrial, public, religious, and nonprofit entities, as well as underwr","summary_zh":"Arthur J. Gallagher & Co. 及其子公司向全球實體和個人提供保險和再保險經紀、諮詢以及第三方財產/傷亡索賠結算和管理服務。該公司從事經紀和風險管理業務。其經紀部門提供零售及批發保險及再保險經紀服務；協助零售經紀人及其他非附屬經紀人安排專業且難以安排的保險；並擔任經紀批發商、管理總代理、管理總承保人，向承保企業分銷專業保險。該部門從事的活動包括行銷、承保、簽發保單、收取保費、任命和監督其他代理人、支付索賠以及談判再保險；並提供保險和再保險安排、損失風險管理以及雇主贊助福利計劃管理等領域的服務。風險管理部門提供合約索賠結算和管理服務；理賠管理、損失控制諮詢和保險財產評估服務。該公司透過代理經紀人和顧問網路提供服務。它為商業、工業、公共、宗教和非營利實體以及保險機構提供服務","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險經紀人","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":302.0,"h":303.09,"l":298.62,"c":298.62,"v":1020600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":298.06,"h":300.27,"l":295.74,"c":300.2,"v":2312400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":299.88,"h":302.4,"l":298.67,"c":298.72,"v":1513500},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":297.88,"h":299.93,"l":296.62,"c":299.62,"v":769100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":299.68,"h":303.17,"l":298.64,"c":302.75,"v":1472400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":303.17,"h":303.25,"l":299.14,"c":302.57,"v":1673400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":304.0,"h":305.95,"l":301.67,"c":303.7,"v":1842600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":304.96,"h":305.48,"l":300.08,"c":300.22,"v":1282400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":299.24,"h":300.87,"l":296.43,"c":299.18,"v":1217200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":298.31,"h":300.0,"l":295.14,"c":299.12,"v":1153100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":298.24,"h":300.44,"l":297.23,"c":298.5,"v":1119300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":297.34,"h":298.32,"l":292.83,"c":293.18,"v":1854700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":293.6,"h":301.02,"l":292.58,"c":300.61,"v":1335100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":299.01,"h":300.81,"l":297.22,"c":297.28,"v":1302100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":297.16,"h":298.16,"l":288.2,"c":289.4,"v":1170000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":287.81,"h":292.75,"l":285.8,"c":291.46,"v":1175600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":293.05,"h":295.21,"l":291.99,"c":292.66,"v":1248100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":293.0,"h":297.02,"l":291.31,"c":296.74,"v":1405700},{"t":"2